B    Training Details
Dataset Construction We sample 5000 queries from the training data of 2WikiMultihopQA, HotpotQA,
and MuSiQue datasets and conduct the MCTS annotations. We then sample 6,000 correct paths and 6,000
incorrect paths, and the correct paths are used to train the policy model, while both paths are used to train
the value model.
Training Process The policy model is initialized using the Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct-1M. Training involves
fine-tuning the model for two epochs with a batch size of 1 and a learning rate of 1 × 10−6 , utilizing 8
NVIDIA A100 80GB GPUs. During inference, the expansion size and the beam search size are set to 3.

